# Experiment outputs: default-ignored to keep the repo small. Specific
# files actually consumed by the thesis figures and tables are allow-listed
# below. New runs land in data/ but stay untracked unless added by hand.

data/**
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ── Allow-listed: what the current figures/tables read ──

